  "notes": [
    "hgm_metadata.jsonl is not JSON Lines: each record is json.dumps(indent=2) followed by a newline, so records span many lines.",
    "The initial node is left out of every record.",
    "A node with no evals has mean_utility Infinity, which Python writes as the bare token Infinity (not valid JSON). load_hgm_metadata reads it back with json.loads.",
    "load_hgm_metadata splits the file on '\\n{' and re-parses each piece.",
    "init_evaluated_tasks.json is overwritten on every update."
